  "description": "Oklahoma's 2nd Congressional District covers 28 counties across eastern Oklahoma, including Green Country and Little Dixie. Incumbent Republican Josh Brecheen, first elected in 2022 and re-elected with 74.2% of the vote in 2024, is seeking a third term. The district is rated as 'Solid Republican' by nonpartisan election forecasters. Brecheen faces a Republican primary challenge from veteran Will Webb on June 16, 2026, while two Democratic candidates \u2014 Erik Terwey and Brandon Wade \u2014 compete for their party's nomination. Independent candidate Ronnie Hopkins is also running in the general election.",
